SomiFinance bundles or embeds the following third-party work. Each remains
under its own licence:

- Chart.js v4.4.1 — MIT — https://github.com/chartjs/Chart.js
  Inlined into every build. Its MIT banner is preserved in the source.
- @kurkle/color v0.3.2 — MIT — Copyright (c) 2018 Jukka Kurkela
  https://github.com/kurkle/color
  Bundled inside the Chart.js distribution above, under its own copyright. Its
  MIT banner is preserved in the source alongside Chart.js's.
- Catppuccin palettes — MIT — https://github.com/catppuccin
  Four of the five themes (Mocha, Macchiato, Frappe, Latte). The default
  Terminal theme is SomiFinance's own.

The TradingView economic-calendar widget is loaded at runtime from
TradingView's servers under their own terms and is not redistributed here.
U.S. Treasury and U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics data are public domain.
